# Physics catalog P5c: the physics stage per frame on a generated graph while
# Springs runs with no arrangement, for the web host's GPU threshold. Run per
# size with ?nodes=<n>&seed=7, once with ?gpu=off and once with
# ?gpu_threshold=0, and compare the timing window's physics stage.
assert snap ready == true
click role:button Play physics
settle 2
assert snap physics-paused == false
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
settle 10
timing start physics-cost
settle 20
timing stop
log-physics timed
log p5 timing receipt complete
